{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D-0H9U7TeqB_YaYkrYwBRw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:18.875058+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D-0H9U7TeqB_YaYkrYwBRw","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5Z8L4Dm2fDOKpIIcuSHm4HwYZXjR16rCvEl4oQL889SKibRXTAO6aJp0QaJ4gNKZRZZYV3icvrXYKPQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>2025年广州大学管理学院</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>全国优秀大学生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>暑期夏令营</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><strong></strong></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动概要</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>      广州大学管理学院希望通过本次活动，为来自全国各地的优秀学子搭建和提供一个学术交流平台，促进学术推广和传播，增进学生对广州大学的了解。</span></p><p><span>     夏令营期间，参与本次活动的同学将通过校史馆参观、学术讲座、知名教授学者面对面交流、名企参访等系列活动，深度体验广州大学的历史文化、学习模式和研究生培养政策等。</span></p><p><span>     本次活动鼓励优秀学子积极展现自我，表现优秀的同学将有机会获得奖励，且将评选出若干优秀营员。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学校与学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>广州大学</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRicGFvXvF43DRQcX95YvX6mXt7liaSFm8vqEhddYzbz1icggiaF8vPGrFSA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>广州大学是以国家重要中心城市“广州”命名的综合性大学，于2000年合并组建，有着90多年的办学传统。学校现有大学城、桂花岗、黄埔研究院/研究生院“一校三园”，在校全日制本科生30160人，硕士和博士研究生8595人。现有全职两院院士5人，国家级人才项目入选者117人、省部级人才项目入选者94人次、广州市高层次人才311人。现有10个一级学科博士授权点和博士专业学位授权点，8个博士后科研流动站，34个学术型硕士学位授权点，30个硕士专业学位授权点。现拥有国家级科研平台（含培育基地）6个，省部级科研平台83个。学校在2024软科中国大学排名中位列主榜第98位，自2020年以来一直稳居国内百强；在2023软科世界大学学术排名中位列世界大学第463位、中国内地高校第78位。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>广州大学管理学院</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRTtJiclrfrUDNVicjlXiaUB6ibibNkNxo20beXsXwuYwkLxhlkweOep5BibMg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>广州大学管理学院拥有工商管理学一级学科博士点，管理科学与工程、工商管理学一级学科硕士点，以及工商管理硕士（MBA）、会计硕士（MPAcc）、工程管理硕士（MEM）、旅游管理硕士（MTA）4个专业学位硕士点；2023年获批设立工商管理学博士后科研流动站。现有教职员工197人，专任教师149人。具有博士学位教师122人，教授21人，副教授51人，博士生导师17人。学院拥有国家级、省级教学平台（质量工程项目）20余个，国家级、省级课程（含一流课程）20余门。承担国家级科研项目80余项，省部级项目100余项，发表高水平论文500余篇，获得国家级教学成果奖1项、省级教学成果奖4项。与20余所世界知名大学及100余家国内外知名企业组织建立了交流与合作关系。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRBgfeVBjaXiaEicSqJoD0am7Y1LZcvqkb7SGOzBagNxMqL4UVglEoYbnQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间及内容安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>开营时间</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>2025年8月25日-26日</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动地点</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>广州大学（大学城校区）</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>具体活动安排</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRnF72QcblLScXB7HAGz7NyP1sIMexNnoEIxcYtGDWYHDPwudg7Ec1TA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.面向群体：</span></strong><span>2026届工商管理类、管理科学与工程类、计算机类、数学类专业应届本科毕业生，或其他有志于攻读工商管理或管理科学与工程专业硕士学位的2026届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><strong><span>2.英语水平良好：</span></strong><span>需提供英语四、六级成绩单、PETS、TOEFL、IELTS等以及其他可以标识语言水平的成绩证明。</span></p><p><span>3.品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，无作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>5.理论基础扎实，有较强的科研实践能力。</span></p><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong><strong><span>鼓励有望获得本科学校推荐免试资格的学生积极申请</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名安排及入营确认</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名时间</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>2025年8月1日-2025年8月15日</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>扫描下方二维码提交所需材料：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRu1q4N9b6k1ibsiaRJWibuicjXvYuOdQoS3DibXAu9sbdhjCiaBNiblHQ4vBeQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>各申请者需提前准备以下材料：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRq1k35e1TMr87C3HWMFF2NlsqsCh4yo7jClBFMiaoXQWVM5Dl3XhxfNQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>注：</span><strong><span>各文件命名方式为“学校-姓名-材料名称”</span></strong><span>。申请者须保证所提交材料的真实性和准确性，如弄虚作假，一经发现将立即取消申请资格、入营资格及优秀营员资格。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRfMOkdoLvmdYWA8P9SB2TMI4MRuKJJ08UXvldhcAygqVECkCtJGg4PQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>审核与入营确认</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.入选营员将在</span><span><strong><span>8月18日（周一）或之前</span></strong></span><span>收到邮件通知，</span><span><strong><span>未入选者将不另行通知</span></strong></span><span>。入选营员须按时回复“确认参加”或“确认不参加”，未在规定时间内回复者，将视为自动放弃。</span><strong><span>请入选营员及时关注系统中的活动安排，以免错失机会</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.其他未尽事宜请参见广州大学管理学院官方通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.不收费用：</span></strong><strong><span><span>本次夏令营申请不收取任何报名费、住宿费、餐饮费。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2.安排食宿：</span></strong><span>学校统一安排住宿、餐饮（包含早餐、午餐和晚餐）。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.交通报销：</span></strong><span>学校将为学生报销往返交通费，具体包含：国内往返广州的交通费（仅限汽车票、火车硬座票、硬卧票、动车二等座及以下的车票），报销需要凭报销凭证，无法提供有效报销凭证（纸质票据原件）则无法报销。</span></p><p><strong><span>4.配发服装：</span></strong><span>夏令营活动期间，学院将为入选者统一发放专用服装。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：周老师</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：17868041443</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：2282049059@qq.com</span></p><p><span><span>咨询时间：9：00-16：30</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRqqaC5EaGWD5wK2VkksF7Wl9DnFAZ1SUeklQeXibGkGd7R1HkU4ct30Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>往期回顾</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3MzEwNDkxOA==&amp;mid=2247514766&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=37ad74b56965f6c3f17c1a9b1125f96b&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRicibI39Ey0plDibiciaW4OSdknfZTlMpIrfoj8RbqibxcBBohGiayzHqJ655g/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3MzEwNDkxOA==&amp;mid=2247513635&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4613368e5f3040387bf8838b56bbbb4d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/nZETJiaQ0E5bkdZ9dqzianFFNqCOQp1XKRvobIkaLDXCibSya7pfmxRrcLglK4RwV7yGpmZnComxUajUCjjVlnMjA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>图文来源 | 广州大学管理学院</span></span></section><section><span><span>文案编辑 | 周婉桦 廖尹鸣</span></span></section><section><span><span>责任编辑 | 孙大伟 廖尹鸣</span></span></section><section><span><span>初审 | 曹兵兵</span></span></section><section><span><span>复审 | 黄琼宇</span></span></section><section><span><span>终审 | 李炎焜</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>///点击关注///</span></span></section><section></section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c3781d7b4363f6a1f2d1f4afc6f8601c8f7094fda6c5dc82cf5c8c657cf01559","textLeng